&lt;p&gt;Takealot Group, the largest and most customer-centric online shopping destination in Africa, is looking for a highly talented &lt;strong&gt;Legal Counsel I&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Legal team in Cape Town.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a young, dynamic, hyper-growth company looking for smart, creative and hard-working people with integrity to join us.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to the Senior Legal Counsel: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://takealot.com/MrD&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Takealot.com/MrD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities will include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review and assist with the negotiation of various commercial contracts on behalf of the Takealot Group businesses, eg &lt;a href=&quot;http://takeal.com&quot;&gt;Takealot.com&lt;/a&gt; and MrD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update and improve template documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on and attend to dispute resolution and general litigation matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on and attend to employment law matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on and attend to banking and finance legal matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the Takealot Group’s intellectual property portfolio and assist with the settlement of intellectual property disputes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and advise on new legal developments affecting the Takealot Group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct legal research, draft legal opinions, and provide legal advice to the &lt;a href=&quot;http://takealot.com&quot;&gt;Takealot.com&lt;/a&gt; and MrD, as required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide and/or facilitate training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with internal stakeholders of &lt;a href=&quot;http://takealot.com&quot;&gt;Takealot.com&lt;/a&gt; and MrD primarily and to the Group, as and when required&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the design, implementation, and management of software and AI technology, and their standard operating procedures (SOPs), to aid the delivery of legal services to &lt;a href=&quot;http://takealot.com&quot;&gt;Takealot.com&lt;/a&gt; and MrD that is scalable to the Group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the legal team as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attributes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive with a consistently positive attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good drafting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work hard independently and within a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritise numerous competing tasks and meet deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate well orally and in writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong planning and organisational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented whilst remaining practical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working knowledge of South African law in general&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LLB, admitted attorney or advocate in South Africa&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years post-admission experience at the bar, a well-established law firm, or in the in-house legal department of a large corporate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in corporate and commercial law is essential, and particularly in drafting&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; and reviewing contracts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and/or mentoring legal professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in e-commerce or retail would be ideal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Environment:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takealot Group employees are entrepreneurial and dynamic, smart, customer-centric, fun, and have the shared ambition of being the leading e-commerce company in Africa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have fun, work hard, take ownership, work in teams to create solutions, and are always open to direct feedback/new ideas on where we can improve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are short on ego and high on output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are doers and not only thinkers, it’s all in the execution after all&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We love what we do and what we are creating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the above criteria and are an&lt;strong&gt; Extraordinary Mind&lt;/strong&gt;, come and join us!&lt;/p&gt;
