&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://superbalist.com/&quot;&gt;Superbalist.com&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/strong&gt; a online fashion destination in South Africa, is looking for a highly talented &lt;strong&gt;Online Fashion Assistant&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team in Cape Town over the &lt;strong&gt;Festive Season&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
