&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the team to reduce the response time for customer queries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Attributes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent command of English, both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in typing, phone handling, and computer navigation&lt;/li&gt;
